<p><br></p>
<h1 id=3D"Supportenable/disabledefaultstorageclass-Background"><span style=
=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">Background</span></h1>
<p>On TMC (SAAS &amp; SM), <em>default</em> storage class is enabled when c=  
reating a TKGm classy workload cluster without any additional settings. Whi=  
le currently, we need to provide <span style=3D"color: rgb(55,65,81);">an a=  
pproach</span> to enable/disable the default storage class(ticket<span styl=  
e=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">&nbsp;<a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https:=
//jira.eng.vmware.com/browse/TMC-40726">TMC-40726</a></span>).</p>
<h1 id=3D"Supportenable/disabledefaultstorageclass-Scope">Scope</h1>
<p><strong>Requirements/Goals:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Allow user to <strong>enable/disabled</strong> default storage class on=
 TKGm classy workload clusters on vsphere.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Non-Goals:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>TKGm on AWS/Azure is not in scope.</li>
<li>Legacy cluster is not scope.</li>
</ul>
<h1 id=3D"Supportenable/disabledefaultstorageclass-Userstories"><span style=
=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">User stories</span></h1>
<p><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">As a TMC user,&nbsp; when provisio=  
ning a <strong>TKGm classy workload cluster</strong> on vsphere, I can</spa=  
n></p>
<ol>
<li><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">Disable default storage class</sp=  
an></li>
<li><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">Enable default storage class</spa=  
n>
<ol>
<li><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">With default settings.</span></li=
>
<li><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">With customized <strong>storage p=  
olicy</strong>(in clusterbootstrap CR).</span></li>
</ol></li>
</ol>
<h1 id=3D"Supportenable/disabledefaultstorageclass-Design">Design</h1>
<h2 id=3D"Supportenable/disabledefaultstorageclass-Highleveldesign">High le=  
vel design</h2>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manu=  
al-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image" draggable=3D"false" heigh=  
t=3D"215" src=3D"461a3706256ff69de3654d04407f82f8" data-image-src=3D"/downl=  
oad/attachments/1837798752/image-2023-11-9_14-40-47.png?      version=3D1&amp;mod=  
ificationDate=3D1699512048000&amp;api=3Dv2" data-unresolved-comment-count=
=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"1837798793" data-linked-resource-version=
=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-defaul=  
t-alias=3D"image-2023-11-9_14-40-47.png" data-base-url=3D"https://confluenc=  
e.eng.vmware.com" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-link=  
ed-resource-container-id=3D"1837798752" data-linked-resource-container-vers=  
ion=3D"8" alt=3D"" width=3D"468"></span></p>
<p><strong>Workflows</strong>( also detailed in <a class=3D"external-link" =  
href=3D"https://miro.com/app/board/uXjVMTlCg1E=3D/">miroboard</a>):</p>
<p>1 RR(resource-retriever) will retrieve datastores (by <a class=3D"extern=  
al-link" href=3D"https://github.com/vmware/govmomi/blob/main/vim25/client.g=  
o">vim25 client</a> of govmomi)</p>
<p>2 RR will retrieve storagePolicies (by <a class=3D"external-link" href=
=3D"https://github.com/vmware/govmomi/blob/main/pbm/client.go">pbm client</=  
a> of govmomi)</p>
<p>3 RR render options, with datastore and store policy</p>
<p>4/5 Sync agent watch options and sync it back to WCM</p>
<p>6 WCM save options and cluster class<s> (with <strong>hacked</strong> va=  
riable defaultStorageClass for Option3)</s></p>
<p>7/8 WCM render to UI inter-ops values when user create WC</p>
<p>9/10 Frontend post user-selected cluster data to WCM</p>
<p>11 Build cluster CR with datastore variable</p>
<p>12 Build CB CR with infraProvider additionalPackages for default storage=
 class</p>
<p><br></p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width: 89.=  
7054%;">
<colgroup class=3D"">
<col class=3D"" style=3D"width: 3.99737%;">
<col class=3D"" style=3D"width: 27.7676%;">
<col class=3D"" style=3D"width: 23.8199%;">
<col class=3D"" style=3D"width: 44.3544%;">
</colgroup>
<tbody class=3D"">
<tr class=3D"">
<th class=3D"confluenceTh"><br></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Options1</th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Options2</th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Option3</th>
</tr>
<tr class=3D"">
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">Solution</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Add a defaultStorageClass checkbox, to enable=
/disable from UI when creating workload clusters.</p><p>Steps:</p>
<ol>
<li>Resource-retriever retrieve the storagePolicy as options, which will be=
 sync back into WCM db.</li>
<li>When user creating workload cluster,
<ol>
<li>Checked checkbox( by default), to enable defaultStorageClass. User can =  
select a storagePolicy for default storage calss, and also can use default =  
storage policy without any settings.</li>
<li>Un-checked checkbox, default storage class will be disabled.</li>
</ol></li>
</ol></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Add a defaultStorageClass dropdown list, to e=  
nable/disable from UI when creating workload clusters.</p><p>Steps:</p>
<ol>
<li>Resource-retriever retrieve the defaultStorageClass as options, which w=  
ill be sync back into WCM db.</li>
<li>When user creating workload cluster,
<ol>
<li>Select the storage class from the dropdown list, default storage class =  
will be created.</li>
<li>Select "" from the dropdown list, default storage class will be not cre=  
ated.</li>
</ol></li>
</ol></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Add a <em>defaultStorageClass</em> variable i=  
n <em>cluster class</em>, to enable/disable from UI (advanced settings) whe=  
n creating workload clusters.</p><p>Steps:</p>
<ol>
<li>Resource-retriever retrieve the storagePolicy as options, which will be=
 sync back into WCM db.</li>
<li>When user creating workload cluster,
<ol>
<li>Checked checkbox( by default), to enable defaultStorageClass, from UI(a=  
dvanced settings). User can select a storagePolicy for default storage cals=  
s, and also can use default storage policy without any settings.</li>
<li>Un-checked checkbox, default storage class will be disabled.</li>
</ol></li>
</ol></td>
</tr>
<tr class=3D"">
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">Pros</span=
></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">Easy to <span style=3D"color: rgb(55,65,81);">im=  
plement.</span></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);"><span styl=  
e=3D"color: rgb(55,65,81);">Same user experience with TKGS.</span></span></=  
td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);"><span styl=  
e=3D"color: rgb(55,65,81);">Easy to implement. User <span style=3D"color: r=  
gb(23,43,77);"><span style=3D"color: rgb(55,65,81);">experience is pretty m=  
uch as TKGS.</span></span></span></span></td>
</tr>
<tr class=3D"">
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">Cons</span=
></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);"><span styl=  
e=3D"color: rgb(55,65,81);">Inconsistencies in the user experience with TKG=  
S.</span></span></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>This is a break change. Currently storagecals=  
s is not supported by clusterclass on TKGm vsphere.</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Need TKGm support this variable.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h2 id=3D"Supportenable/disabledefaultstorageclass-UX">UX</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width: 84.=  
2062%;">
<colgroup class=3D"">
<col class=3D"" style=3D"width: 11.8415%;">
<col class=3D"" style=3D"width: 49.5826%;">
<col class=3D"" style=3D"width: 19.1914%;">
<col class=3D"" style=3D"width: 0.174997%;">
</colgroup>
<tbody class=3D"">
<tr class=3D"">
<th class=3D"confluenceTh"><br></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Option1</th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Option2</th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Options3</th>
</tr>
<tr class=3D"">
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<div class=3D"content-wrapper">
<p><strong>Solution</strong></p>
</div></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<div class=3D"content-wrapper">
<p>Add a checkbox, on following position( position1 is suggested)</p>
<p><strong><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embed=  
ded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image" draggable=3D"fals=  
e" height=3D"127" src=3D"cbf6e2bab894116dd9eb19cf37cf35b1" data-image-src=
=3D"/download/attachments/1837798752/image-2023-10-22_18-0-26.png?      version=
=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1699511840000&amp;api=3Dv2" data-unresolved-com=  
ment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"1837798746" data-linked-resourc=  
e-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resour=  
ce-default-alias=3D"image-2023-10-22_18-0-26.png" data-base-url=3D"https://=  
confluence.eng.vmware.com" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" =  
data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"1837798752" data-linked-resource-conta=  
iner-version=3D"8" alt=3D"" width=3D"468"></span></strong></p>
</div><p><strong>To disable <span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">default s=  
torage class: </span></strong><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">uncheck=  
ed</span></p><p><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);"><strong>To enable def=  
ault storage class: </strong>checked, by default.</span></p><p><span style=
=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);"><strong>To select storagePolicyName</strong>:<sp=  
an class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-siz=  
e"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image" draggable=3D"false" height=3D"1=  
05" src=3D"061b20ade9f3694ee3daee277259ba23" data-image-src=3D"/download/at=  
tachments/1837798752/image-2023-10-20_19-55-43.png?      version=3D1&amp;modifica=  
tionDate=3D1699511840000&amp;api=3Dv2" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" =  
data-linked-resource-id=3D"1837798747" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" d=  
