<h2 id=3D"Supportenable/disabledefaultstorageclass-Resource-retrieverretrie=  
vestoragePolicy"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">Resource-retriever r=  
etrieve storagePolicy</span></h2>
<ul>
<li><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">Resource retriever will retrieve =  
storagePolicy only those <strong>with compatible datastore</strong>, e.g. g=  
ovc demo <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://github.com/vmware/govmo=  
mi/blob/main/pbm/client_test.go#L88">here</a></span></li>
<li><p><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">Render the options as followin=  
gs</span></p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">=20
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">k get v=  
o options -n vmware-system-tmc -oyaml | yq .spec.tkgOptions.storagePolicies
  
storagePolicies:
  - name: Management Storage Policy - Large
    id: cd8f7c94-3e11-67fc-17f5-4e96d91a5beb
 &nbsp; &nbsp;description: Management Storage policy used for VMC large clu=  
ster
  ...
 &nbsp;- name: vSAN ESA Default Policy - RAID6
    id: 865b5d61-54ce-42b7-8827-1095bef6c470
 &nbsp; &nbsp;description: Default vSAN ESA RAID6 storage policy for vSAN d=  
atastore.</pre>=20
</div>
</div></li>
</ul>
<h2 id=3D"Supportenable/disabledefaultstorageclass-WCM(workload-cluster-man=  
ager)"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">WCM(workload-cluster-manager)<=
/span></h2>
<ul>
<li>WCM sync processor save the storagePolicies into DB.
<ul>
<li>The data would be storaged into <em>provider_options</em> table of <em>=  
wcm_db, </em>no db schema change.</li>
</ul></li>
<li><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">WCM renders the storage policy na=  
me to UI, when cluster creating.</span></li>
<li>WCM validate the input, user selected <strong>storagePolicy</strong><s>=
/</s><strong><s>datastore</s>, </strong>and custom the <em>clusterbootstrap=
 </em>as required.</li>
</ul>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"margin-left: 80.0px;">
