&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ...
&nbsp; paused: false</pre>=20
</div>=20
</div>
</div></td>
</tr>
<tr class=3D"">
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">enabled</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>For example:</p><p>"<em><span style=3D"color:=
 rgb(0,51,102);">Management Storage Policy - Regular</span></em>"</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>yes. WCM need to</p>
<ol>
<li>Validate the storagePolicyName is in options.storagePolicies</li>
<li>Vcenter datastore is compatible with the storagePolicy.</li>
</ol><p style=3D"margin-left: 80.0px;"><br></p></td>
