<p style=3D"margin-left: 40.0px;">&nbsp;For <strong>Option3</strong>, there=
 is no need to customize clusterbootstrap, because</p>
<ol>
<li style=3D"list-style-type: none;">
<ul>
<li><p><em>defaultStorageClass </em>is a variable defined in<em> spec.vaira=  
bles</em> of cluster class. (Currently need to hack from WCM side, because =  
TKGm is not supported yet)</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">=20
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: yml; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">- name: =  
defaultStorageClass
  required: false
  schema: &nbsp; &nbsp;=20
    openAPIV3Schema:
      default:
        enabled: true
      description: storage policy should have compatible datastore.
      properties:
        enabled:
          default: true
          type: boolean
      type: object</pre>=20
</div>
</div></li>
<li><p><em>storagePolicy</em> is a variable <strong>already supported</stro=  
ng> in spec.variables of cluster class.</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">=20
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: yml; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">- name: =  
vcenter
  required: true
  schema:
    openAPIV3Schema:
        storagePolicyID:
          default: ""
          type: string</pre>=20
</div>
</div></li>
</ul></li>
</ol>
