</tr>
<tr class=3D"">
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">Need to add a var <em>defaultStorageCalss.</em><=
/td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">No change. (The default storageclass will be sav=  
ed into <em>spec</em> <em>variables</em>.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">No change. (The default storageclass will be sav=  
ed into <em>spec</em> <em>variables</em>.)</td>
</tr>
